\pard\plain \tx0\tx360\tx720\tx1080\tx1440\tx1800\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\fi360\ltrch\loch {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 1. Catherine is born in the Southern Elven Empire (Inspired by Ancient Greek) the Empire is an Elven Society, one of the last and the safe haven for their kind, }
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 2. Catherine or Kathrii attended one of their Forums, the forum tells the story THEME, but the first few I could think of are of Xenophobia, and that everyone else are envious of the Elven status. And that the Elves are the chosen people of the creator, Kathrii didn\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92t buy to the speech (She\u8217\'92s around 13 at that time)}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 3. The Elven Empire is attacked by the Northern Men Empire. (Inspired by the Romans) the Elves are massacred, most of them are taken as a slave, including Kathrii who were only 15 at that time}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 4. In the Northern Empire, Kathrii was sold at the market, nobody bought her, (All of the elves had blond hair, whilst her had red, and she looked different bacuse she was a wood elf) and so those who were unbought, are taken by the government, and in her case, she was made to be an Outrider Soldiers, a honorable sounding name, but essentially cannon fodders.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 5. Kathrii was sent to the East as part of their Campaign, the East are notorious with dangerous element, and even more dangerous people}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 6. Kathrii\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92s unit was ambushed, most of them killed, and most of them captured, including her.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 7. They were sold at the Eastern Market, this time, she accepted her fate, she is probably had died already}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 8. She is bought by an old Alchemist called Casnius Bolos, saying that he needed an assistant for his lab}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 9. Dialogue idea}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Assistant\u8230\'85 but.. I\u8217\'92m your slave.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Not anymore, I needed an assistant who can think.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93But\u8230\'85\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93What does it take for me to free you?\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93I\u8230\'85 I don\u8217\'92t know.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Your chains are broken, you\u8217\'92re free, now help me with my research.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 10. Kathrii learnt about Freedom}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 11. Casnius Bolos eventually comes of age, and died.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 12. Kathrii was so distraught with grief, that she cut her own hair (since she now hits 25, she couldn\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92t grow them back anymore) and tried to resurrect Bolos, only to discover that he chooses to pass away rather than be Immortal.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 13. Kathrii taught the arts of Alchemy to the Empire of the Eastern Dunes, she did so under the name of Casnius Bolos, for decades, for centuries, she does that across the Isles, her name not known, but Bolos\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92s name was.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 14. She eventually returned to the Northern Empire (Who now had fallen into several kingdoms) to teach, and clear her name, when she introduces herself as Kathrii, the King mispelt it as Catherine. This she accepts as her new name in the North.}}